<title>FRANCE: Bon Marche plans 450 mln capital increase.</title>
<headline>Bon Marche plans 450 mln capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bon Marche said on Friday it planned a 450 million franc capital increase to be reserved for financial company Agache.</p>
<p>The increase will involve the issuing of 282,000 shares  at an issue price of 1,596 FF. The shares are nominally priced 100 francs.</p>
<p>The issue price is equal to the price at which Financiere Agache bought out minority shareholders of Bon Marche.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 jpp/pmc</p>
</text>
